<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June palm oil output up 1.8 pct - MOPGC.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June palm oil output up 1.8 pct - MOPGC.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malaysian Oil Palm Growers' Council (MOPGC) has estimated Malaysia's crude palm oil output in June at 805,000 tonnes, up 1.8 percent from May, traders who obtained the data said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Private crop forecaster Ivan Wong had estimated June production at 788,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority is due to release official June crop data at 0430 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-275-6834)</p>
</text>
